    "problem": "How do events survive crashes and offline time, and still flush when a batch is too large?",
    "reading": "Feature code calls track, the interceptors filter and redact, and Room holds every event. The scheduler starts one unique FlushWorker, which uploads batches and deletes only what the server acknowledged.",
